ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMr. Zhao is a respected historian, focusing on the study of ancient Chinese military strategy. In a public lecture, someone asks Mr. Zhao if he ever provides advice to the military. Mr. Zhao replies that his research only limits to the academic field and never involves in actual military strategy. He adds that his interest only lies in history, unrelated to the present. In fact, Mr. Zhao secretly participates in an important national defense project.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Mr. Zhao say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mr. Zhao just experiences a failed collaboration, he says this to avoid getting involved in unpleasant projects again.\nB. Mr. Zhao says this because he needs to cover up the truth of participating in the national defense project, to protect himself and the safety of the project.\nC. Mr. Zhao says this because he is not actually interested in military strategy, preferring to study ancient culture and art.\nD. Mr. Zhao is misunderstood as having a military background, he says this to clarify that he is just a scholar, unrelated to the military.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001700689874971802,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52baac2ddb05a7fe30ec3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452394449,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:59:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ad3ec4ba9c38498a9f33ba59b1d6eed4"}